`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Capture your thoughts before they fade."})," Talk through what happened in a meeting as it comes back to you, and Claude keeps track of the pieces. The conversation saves like any chat, so you can ask for the decisions and action items later as text."]}),`
