`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.ul,{children:[`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"It keeps up with harder questions:"})," On paid plans, voice conversations can now run on more capable Claude models, Opus and Sonnet, in addition to our quicker model, Haiku. You can also switch models mid-conversation as things get more complex using the model picker. The model you already use for text carries over to voice."]}),`
`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"It can reach your daily tools, mid-conversation:"})," On paid plans, Claude can now pull from your connected apps (email, calendar, docs, Slack) without you leaving the conversation. (Searching the web is not new; voice could already do that.) Ask it to catch you up on today's email while you make coffee."]}),`
