`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"You can start in one and finish in the other. Think something through in voice mode on a walk, and when you've made up your mind, ask Claude to sum up the plan. The conversation is saved like any other chat, so everything you talked through is there as text when you come back to it. Open it again at your desk and dictate the follow-up."}),`
